# Sentinella AI Monitor - Environment Configuration Template
# 
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# - NEVER commit .env.local or any .env file containing real API keys to Git
# - Copy this file to .env.local and add your actual API key
# - The .env.local file is already in .gitignore to prevent accidental commits
#
# To use this file:
# 1. Copy: cp .env.local.example .env.local
# 2. Edit .env.local and replace the placeholder with your actual API key
# 3. Get your API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey

# Google Gemini API Key (required for AI analysis)
# Format: AIza... (39 characters)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
